{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>And they answered, etc., saying to him.</b> Meaning: since not many would speak, therefore it says ״לֵאמֹר לוֹ״ — for one would speak to him on behalf of them all." "<b>Further,</b> it intends to say that they did not agree among themselves regarding the matter stated in their reply, but rather ״לֵאמֹר לוֹ״ — and as their end revealed about their beginning, ״בְּכֶסֶף מָלֵא״."], :book :genesis, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:42:47.743509452Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}